WEBVTT

00:02.604 --> 00:08.549
Meet Samantha. A small AI that lives on your Mac. She paints from thirty thousand squares.

00:08.599 --> 00:13.178
She runs your Mac, keeps your reminders and finds your files.

00:13.228 --> 00:17.916
She does the math.

00:17.966 --> 00:33.891
She keeps your notes, defines words and counts the days.

00:33.941 --> 00:39.888
On a real Mac she researches, reads your screen and clicks for you. She always asks first.

00:39.938 --> 00:47.450
Samantha. Free and private, on your Mac. Download her at turing dot heyitsmejosh dot com.

